# Keep Linux line endings in the repo and in every checkout, including Windows.
# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers; with CRLF endings they fail on the first line
# ("env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory"), so Postgres never creates its roles.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
